flowchart TD

    A[Admin opens Student Progress] --> B[Admin selects a student]
    B --> C[Open Certificate panel for selected student]

    C --> D[System loads student tier]
    D --> E[System checks student completion eligibility]

    E --> F{Eligible for certificate?}

    F -->|No| G[Show certificate not eligible state]
    G --> C

    F -->|Yes| H[Show available certificates based on tier]

    H --> I{Tier type}

    I -->|Starter Kit| J[Available: Bikram Yoga Certificate]
    I -->|Online| K[Available: Bikram Yoga Certificate and Yoga Alliance Certificate]
    I -->|Master Class| L[Available: Bikram Yoga Certificate and Yoga Alliance Certificate]

    J --> M[Admin clicks Generate or Regenerate]
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M --> N[System loads JPG template]
    N --> O[System renders student name into template]
    O --> P[System generates final PDF]
    P --> Q[System stores certificate file]
    Q --> R[Certificate available for admin download]
    R --> C

    C --> S[Admin clicks Download PDF]
    S --> T[Download generated certificate]

    %% Student side
    U[Student opens Certificate page] --> V[System loads student's generated certificates]
    V --> W{Certificate available?}

    W -->|No| X[Show empty state]
    W -->|Yes| Y[Show downloadable certificate list]

    Y --> Z[Student clicks Download PDF]
    Z --> AA[Download student certificate]